// Roles: which of Foundry's monsters fit which part in a prefab.
//
// A role is a name a prefab's `Monster(role: "name", band: N)` slot asks
// for, and the monsters from monsters.ron that fit it. Where and how often
// each monster turns up is monster_spawns.ron's; a role only says who may
// stand in the slot, and a draw for it is the spawn table restricted to
// the role's members at the deck plus the slot's band. A monster may fit
// several roles.
//
// Every field:
//   the map's key:   the role's name, unique
//   the map's value: a list of monster names, at least one, none twice
// Every member here is a droid. Droids and vermin fight each other, so a
// scrap crab drawn to hold a post beside two droid sentries is shot by
// them the moment either wakes.
// ANCHOR: roles
{
    "sentry": ["probe droid", "trooper droid"],
    "brute":  ["line droid", "heavy droid"],
}
// ANCHOR_END: roles
